														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-inner {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\theight: 353px;\n\t\toverflow: hidden;\n\t\twidth: 682.99px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next, .carousel-control-prev {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover, .carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: rgb(0, 0, 0);\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(-90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-indicators li {\n\t\tborder-radius: 50%;\n\t\tborder: solid 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;\n\t\theight: 10px !important;\n\t\twidth: 10px !important;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tComprehensive\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><p>Built on a scalable, secure cloud infrastructure, InsureGuard supports every stage of the insurance lifecycle. From onboarding and policy servicing to claims and renewals, our platform ensures a unified, consistent experience for both customers and internal teams.</p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tCloud-Native Insurance Experience Platform\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><p>With real-time analytics, workflow automation, and AI-driven insights, InsureGuard not only enhances user experience but also improves decision-making and operational efficiency. It's the all-in-one solution for insurers looking to digitize processes without compromising compliance, flexibility, or innovation.</p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></div>"
