														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.catalog-icon {\n\t\twidth: 90px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\n\t\t\t<h1 class=\"mb-6\">\n\t\t\t\tAIMDek Technologies Pvt. Ltd.\n\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"company-description-container mb-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>AIMDek is a digital innovation enabler since 2014 that helps enterprises gain personalized and integrated digital solutions. With collaborative power of technologies and in-depth domain expertise, we venture into the world of Life Sciences, Digital Health and evolving MedTech industry to serve Enterprises that are not just creating technology solutions but addressing integral humanity problems.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"bg-white company-description-icons-container d-flex justify-content-between px-8 py-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/insureguard/021.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"m-0\">Website</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"font-weight-bold\" href=\"https://www.aimdek.com\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twww.aimdek.com\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center d-flex mr-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"company-icon\" aria-label=\"video-thumbnail\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group